"                                pg_upgrade 所在目录相同）\n"

#: option.c:295
#, c-format
msgid ""
"  -c, --check                   check clusters only, don't change any data\n"
msgstr "  -c, --check                   仅检查集簇，不更改任何数据\n"

#: option.c:296
#, c-format
